# Rotkeeper is a POSIX toolchain: bash scripts, templates, markdown sources and
# checked-in fixtures are consumed byte-for-byte (renders are diffed against
# goldens with cmp). Everything must check out LF even where a git client
# defaults to autocrlf (Git for Windows), otherwise rendered output diverges
# from fixtures and embedded \r leaks into generated HTML.
* text=auto eol=lf
